  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a cast iron skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and minced garlic and sauté until fragrant.",
    "Stir in ground annatto, cumin, coriander, paprika, and cinnamon and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chicken thighs and brown on all sides.",
    "Pour in chicken broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and let cook for 25 minutes until chicken is tender.",
    "Spread toasted almonds on top, replace cover, and bake in a preheated wood‑fire oven at 200C for 15 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and squeeze lemon juice over the tagine.",
    "Season with salt and pepper, then sprinkle fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve hot with a side of sautéed greens.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
  ],
